Job Description
Seeking an experienced ServiceNow Solutions Architect to lead platform architecture, governance, and enterprise solution design.
The candidate will support ServiceNow CMDB and foundational services while ensuring platform solutions align with organizational goals, security, and operational requirements.

Key Responsibilities
Design and architect enterprise ServiceNow solutions.
Lead platform governance and technical architecture.
Support ServiceNow CMDB and foundational services.
Design integrations with enterprise applications, APIs, and workflows.
Guide developers, administrators, and project teams.
Manage platform upgrades, performance, and roadmap planning.
Ensure security, compliance, and operational standards.

